<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIA INTERNATIONAL MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIA INTERNATIONAL MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia International men's</p>
<p>tournament first round results on Tuesday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>1-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Gabriel Silberstein (Chile) 6-0</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>2-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Davide Sanguinetti (Italy) 5-7 4-2</p>
<p>(retired)</p>
<p>3-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Andrei Cherkasov (Russia) 6-2 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) beat Andrei Pavel (Romania) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>8-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat Juan Marin (Spain) 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>Alberto Marin (Spain) beat Patric Fredricsson (Sweden) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>David Caballero (Spain) beat Orlin Stanochev (Bulgaria) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Fernando Vicente (Spain) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) 6-1 2-1</p>
<p>(retired)</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) beat Dinu Pescariu (Romania) 6-1 2-6 7-6</p>
<p>(9-7)</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Nuno Marques (Portugal) 4-6 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Sasa Hirszon (Croatia) 6-1 6-2</p>
</text>
